  "title": "Bentley Systems, Incorporated Declares Second Quarter 2026 Dividend",
  "summary": "EXTON, Pa. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 22, 2026-- Bentley Systems, Incorporated (Nasdaq: BSY) (the “Company”), the infrastructure engineering software company, today announced that its Board of Directors (the “Board”) declared a $0.07 per share dividend for the second quarter of 2026.",
